{"id":"00345","root":"uni00345_1","name":{"ja":"フォルシア","en":"Faurecia"},"title":{"ja":"【隠遁バニー】","en":"【Reclusive Bunny】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【隠遁バニー】 フォルシア","en":"【Reclusive Bunny】 Faurecia"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-06-15","limited":false,"characterId":57,"profile":{"ja":"元々はヒッソリと生きていた魔界の弱小種族だが、ある時研究所に捕えられ、乱暴な肉体の改造を施されてしまう。改造に耐え、唯一生き残ったフォルシアは新たな力を与えられたが、その力を使い研究所を破壊し逃亡する。その後も特徴的な見た目から、虐げようとするものがあとを断たなかったが、力を使ってなぎ倒す事が出来るようになった。しかしその代償として、毎度痛みにのたうちまわる事になり、できるだけ戦いを避けながら生き延びている。その後は争いの絶えない魔界より平穏な人間界で静かに暮らそうと、人間の生活様式や文化を学んでいる。","en":"Faurecia was originally a weak-born species living quietly in the Demon Realm, until she was captured by a laboratory and subjected to brutal bodily modifications. She survived the alterations and was granted new power, which she used to destroy the lab and escape. Her distinctive appearance continually attracted those who sought to oppress her, but she learned to crush her attackers with her newfound strength. The price is constant, excruciating pain, so she strives to avoid combat whenever possible. Seeking a quieter life, Faurecia now studies human customs and culture, hoping to settle peacefully in the Human Realm."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00345_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1012,2024],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[143,286],"def":[121,242],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","630007"]},{"id":"uni00345_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1524,3048],"sp":[210,210],"atk":[221,442],"def":[177,354],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","630007","630008"]},{"id":"uni00345_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2036,4068],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[304,610],"def":[238,475],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","630007","630008"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"